OL,4,CMurder accused said he wanted to join  
OL,5,Cwoman found in freezer, trial hears    
OL,6,GA man accused of murdering his friend  
OL,7,Gand keeping her body in his freezer    
OL,8,Grefused medication and food after his  
OL,9,Garrest and told officers he wanted to  
OL,10,Gjoin her, a court has heard.           
OL,12,FGeorge Gordon, 65, kept the            
OL,13,Fdismembered body of Delia McInerney in 
OL,14,Fa chest freezer, along with her five   
OL,15,Fguinea pigs, for almost three years    
OL,16,Fafter he allegedly murdered her in     
OL,17,FApril 2023, Liverpool Crown Court has  
OL,18,Fheard.                                 
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
